            "created_at": "2025-08-18T22:42:15.430472+00:00",
            "notes": "It's best to grab [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) first. This power can get a ton of value against a variety of teams, but the best thing is that it allows Moira to turbo farm cash due to how much damage she can output with it in the very early game. This will allow you to get everything you need to make the build really shine later.\n\nThe other benefit of choosing [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) first is that you can pivot to a different build in round 3 if you feel like you won't benefit from [Empowering You](item_d4d9b084-65c6-4f90-90b2-664157d28aeb) enough to make it work.",
