            "created_at": "2025-08-18T22:42:15.749882+00:00",
            "notes": "You're going to want to focus on building your weapon speed up to allow you to deal big damage with [Chain Grasp](item_17b85f3e-1b10-410d-8e02-c7ff61f502a0) and also pump your tank up with fat healing. Weapon speed depletes biotic resource faster, so you can add either [Bio-Needles](item_fc8b5d34-98ab-412f-9e01-768d1986507f) to manually refill your resource faster or [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) which does require you to burn fade to get that resource back. I personally prefer Bio-Needles since it lets you stack more weapon speed earlier than if you grabbed Alt. Energy.\n\nBesides that, [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) or [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) to get that weapon speed up is where we're at now.",
