        {
            "id": "592208af-723f-4277-b97d-9c6f8358f68d",
            "build_id": "804a496e-2bde-4203-a162-511208a399e7",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-18T22:42:16.044232+00:00",
            "notes": "This is the Decision round. If you feel like your team is doing well enough that you can do other things besides simply heal and deal damage, [Empowering You](item_d4d9b084-65c6-4f90-90b2-664157d28aeb) is the choice. If you're struggling and you feel like you need to be doing something else, then this is the time to swap over to a traditional weapon speed or orb build. Fun thing about Empowering You is that it also generates biotic resource for your primary healing.\n\nThe idea behind the build past this point is that you pre-heal your tank with the beam, throw the healing orb, and then damage boost your tank. This allows you to heal your tank, damage boost them, and also damage two nearby enemies at the same time. This is why we stack weapon speed and weapon power to maximize the damage we're doing while also propping our tank damage up more.\n\n(One other thing is that weapon speed and power stack multiplicatively with beam weapons, versus the same amount of either. Example: with 100 damage and 50% weapon power or weapon speed, a beam does 150 damage. With 25% weapon power AND 25% weapon speed, you're actually doing 156.25 damage, gaining over 6 more dps. This is why we want to grab both and not just one or the other.)",
