            "notes": "I like to get [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) here to prop up the orb healing and also apply more damage, but I think [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) would be good too if you wanted to drop the AP part and go all in on weapon speed and power. \n\nIf you wanna be really nasty, stack [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) instead of smart orbs and champion's kit to debuff your enemies too.\n\nChain Grasp and Empowering You allow for some pretty flexible builds that work with other powers too.",
